{"id":1745706,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:45.445Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745706,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Anugerah Cinta Aisyah","overview":"# The Story  The story tells of Aisyah, a graduate from Egypt who returns to Malaysia and works as a substitute religious teacher. Aisyah takes over her father Ustaz Saleh's position, teaching Islamic studies at the home of Dato' Khaleed and Datin Zariah. The couple had previously gone astray but wish to repent. Their son Zahril behaves wildly and has a girlfriend named Serena, a singer at a club. Meanwhile, Aisyah is actually waiting for the return of Syazwan, her boyfriend from their studies together in Egypt, with whom she promised to marry. Zahril's wild behavior is rebuked by his parents who want him to repent. His mother asks Zahril to end his relationship with Serena. This situation sparks conflict within Dato' Khaleed's family. Aisyah is warmly welcomed by Datin, who likes Aisyah's personality and her characteristics as a Muslim girl. Serena begins to argue with Zahril, who does not support her singing offer to Budapest.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/vhEp8WpY9phitOC480jMP4KweIs.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":289412,"logo_path":null,"name":"Zeel Production","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Anugerah Cinta Aisyah","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1742583,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Ruhainies","original_name":"Ruhainies","popularity":0.4869,"profile_path":"/qYLQAsUXTxVxLmi7ejoWdnIMxIC.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a76b92ffdc9cb2027bbb603","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1739288,"known_